      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4\\sqrt{45}+\\sqrt{80}&=4\\sqrt{9\\times5}+\\sqrt{16\\times5}\\\\4\\sqrt{45}+\\sqrt{80}&=12\\sqrt{5}+4\\sqrt{5}\\\\4\\sqrt{45}+\\sqrt{80}&=16\\sqrt{5}\\end{align*}$$",
